# Build output. Cloudflare Pages builds this itself; a committed copy only
# creates doubt about which build is actually live — which is exactly the
# confusion that hid three weeks of work.
dist

# Dependencies. These were committed, all 8,869 files of them, and they carry
# platform-specific binaries: rollup ships a different native module per OS, so
# a checkout made on one machine fails to build on another with
# MODULE_NOT_FOUND. A Linux CI runner installing on top of a macOS tree is the
# exact case that breaks. package-lock.json is what makes installs reproducible;
# the tree itself is not.
node_modules

# Leftover from when this was a Vercel project.
.vercel

.DS_Store
*.log
